<span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Impact on Numerical Reasoning</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
